// Generated by Duke Forger from the design brief ("JediCompleteUniverseEngine"), adapted to compile in DukeGame and to
// use the existing Duke characters: Empire garrisons are ADukeTrooper, Empire deaths weaken their territory, the
// lightsaber trace deflects ADukeBlasterBolt.
//   Weapons      ADukeWeaponBase (pickup, equip to a hand socket, holster to a belt socket, drop with physics),
//                ADukeLightsaberWeapon (blade length, frame-to-frame tip sweep, bolt deflection),
//                ADukeBlasterRifleWeapon (crosshair hitscan for the player), UAnimNotifyState_DukeSaberPhysics
//   Galaxy       ADukeTerritoryZone (occupied / contested / liberated), ADukeSmartNPC (daily schedule, family, feuds,
//                loot), ADukeOccupationStructure (outposts and mega-bases: perimeter breach spawns the garrison),
//                ADukeDestructibleStructure (destroyed -> rebuilt over time), UDukeGalaxyDirector (oppression sweeps,
//                liberation, the all-out-war endgame, new settlements), FDukeTatooineNames
//   Player       ADukeJediPlayer (Enhanced Input: strike, interact/pick up, draw/holster the lightsaber)
#pragma once

